{"page":506,"verses":[{"verse_key":"46:29","surah":46,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذْ صَرَفْنَآ إِلَيْكَ نَفَرًا مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ يَسْتَمِعُونَ ٱلْقُرْءَانَ فَلَمَّا حَضَرُوهُ قَالُوٓا۟ أَنصِتُوا۟ ۖ فَلَمَّا قُضِىَ وَلَّوْا۟ إِلَىٰ قَوْمِهِم مُّنذِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent a group of jinn to you [Prophet] to listen to the Quran. When they heard it, they said to one another, ‘Be quiet!’ Then when it was finished they turned to their community and gave them warning.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":2,"ar":"صَرَفْنَآ","en_gloss":"We directed","transliteration":"ṣarafnā","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَفَرًۭا","en_gloss":"a party","transliteration":"nafaran","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلْجِنِّ","en_gloss":"the jinn","transliteration":"l-jini","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَسْتَمِعُونَ","en_gloss":"listening","transliteration":"yastamiʿūna","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","en_gloss":"(to) the Quran","transliteration":"l-qur'āna","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَضَرُوهُ","en_gloss":"they attended it","transliteration":"ḥaḍarūhu","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَنصِتُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"Listen quietly","transliteration":"anṣitū","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُضِىَ","en_gloss":"it was concluded","transliteration":"quḍiya","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَّوْا۟","en_gloss":"they turned back","transliteration":"wallaw","verse_key":"46:29"},{"pos":16,"ar":"إِلَى