"verse_key":"46:31"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَيُجِرْكُم","en_gloss":"and will protect you","transliteration":"wayujir'kum","verse_key":"46:31"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"46:31"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابٍ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","verse_key":"46:31"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَلِيمٍۢ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmin","verse_key":"46:31"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:31"}]},{"verse_key":"46:32","surah":46,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن لَّا يُجِبْ دَاعِىَ ٱللَّهِ فَلَيْسَ بِمُعْجِزٍ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَيْسَ لَهُۥ مِن دُونِهِۦٓ أَوْلِيَآءُ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who fail to respond to God’s call cannot escape God’s power anywhere on earth, nor will they have any protector against Him: such people have clearly gone far astray.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُجِبْ","en_gloss":"respond","transliteration":"yujib","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"دَاعِىَ","en_gloss":"(to the) caller","transliteration":"dāʿiya","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"then not","transliteration":"falaysa","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِمُعْجِزٍۢ","en_gloss":"he can escape","transliteration":"bimuʿ'jizin","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walaysa","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":13,"ar":"دُونِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"protectors","transliteration":"awliyāu","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(are) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","en_gloss":"error","transliteration":"ḍalālin","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مُّبِينٍ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnin","verse_key":"46:32"},{"pos":19,"ar":"٣٢","en_gloss":"(32)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"46:32"}]},{"verse_key":"46:33","surah":46,"ayah":33,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ وَلَمْ يَعْىَ بِخَلْقِهِنَّ بِقَـٰدِرٍ عَلَىٰٓ أَن يُحْـِۧىَ ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ ۚ بَلَىٰٓ إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do the disbelievers not understand that God, who created the heavens and earth and did not tire in doing so, has the power to bring the dead back to life? Yes indeed! He has power over everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"awalam","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَرَوْا۟","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yaraw","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلَقَ","en_gloss":"created","transliteration":"khalaqa","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","verse_key":"46:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَمْ","en_gloss