سِقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Be steadfast [Muhammad], like those messengers of firm resolve. Do not seek to hasten the punishment for the disbelievers: on the Day they see what they had been warned about, it will seem to them that they lingered no more than a single hour of a single day [in this life]. This is a warning. Shall any be destroyed except the defiant?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَٱصْبِرْ","en_gloss":"So be patient","transliteration":"fa-iṣ'bir","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"صَبَرَ","en_gloss":"had patience","transliteration":"ṣabara","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُو۟لُوا۟","en_gloss":"those of determination","transliteration":"ulū","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْعَزْمِ","en_gloss":"those of determination","transliteration":"l-ʿazmi","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلرُّسُلِ","en_gloss":"the Messengers","transliteration":"l-rusuli","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَسْتَعْجِل","en_gloss":"seek to hasten","transliteration":"tastaʿjil","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"As if they had","transliteration":"ka-annahum","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَرَوْنَ","en_gloss":"they see","transliteration":"yarawna","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُوعَدُونَ","en_gloss":"they were promised","transliteration":"yūʿadūna","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":16,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"46:35"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يَلْبَثُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"remained"